                    <div class="terms-sections" data-terms-sections>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="scope" data-term-section data-searchable-text="1. Scope and platform identity These Terms govern your use of this independent lottery information and wagering platform. We are not the Government Lottery Office (GLO), not an official agent, and not a government portal. GLO product rules are referenced only for prize-rule compatibility. " aria-labelledby="scope-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">01</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="scope-title">1. Scope and platform identity</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>These Terms govern your use of this independent lottery information and wagering platform. We are not the Government Lottery Office (GLO), not an official agent, and not a government portal. GLO product rules are referenced only for prize-rule compatibility.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="products" data-term-section data-searchable-text="2. Products and prize rules GLO-compatible L6: ticket price 80.00 THB; full-sale allocation 48,000,000.00 THB across 1,000,000 units; 14,168 prizes in the full-sale schedule; prizes scale proportionally when sales are below full sale. GLO-compatible N3: ticket price 20.00 THB; prize pool is 60% of N3 gross sales; payouts are variable and draw-calculated — never fixed historical amounts. Operator markets (3D, TOD, 2D, Run) are platform products. They are never described as GLO N3 or as government lottery products." aria-labelledby="products-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">02</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="products-title">2. Products and prize rules</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>GLO-compatible L6: ticket price 80.00 THB; full-sale allocation 48,000,000.00 THB across 1,000,000 units; 14,168 prizes in the full-sale schedule; prizes scale proportionally when sales are below full sale.</p>\n
                                                                            <p>GLO-compatible N3: ticket price 20.00 THB; prize pool is 60% of N3 gross sales; payouts are variable and draw-calculated — never fixed historical amounts.</p>\n
                                                                            <p>Operator markets (3D, TOD, 2D, Run) are platform products. They are never described as GLO N3 or as government lottery products.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="stamp-duty" data-term-section data-searchable-text="3. Prize duty and tax treatment Stamp duty: 1.00 THB for every 200 THB of gross prize or fraction thereof (ceil(gross/200) × 1.00 THB). Prize income under this rule is treated as stamp-duty only; income tax is exempt on the displayed calculation. No 0.5% or 1% withholding model is used on this platform. " aria-labelledby="stamp-duty-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">03</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="stamp-duty-title">3. Prize duty and tax treatment</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>Stamp duty: 1.00 THB for every 200 THB of gross prize or fraction thereof (ceil(gross/200) × 1.00 THB). Prize income under this rule is treated as stamp-duty only; income tax is exempt on the displayed calculation. No 0.5% or 1% withholding model is used on this platform.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="accounts" data-term-section data-searchable-text="4. Accounts and verification One account per verified user where enforced: email, username, and phone are unique at registration. Identity verification requirements may vary by account, product, and channel. We never promise a single fixed verification path for every user." aria-labelledby="accounts-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">04</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="accounts-title">4. Accounts and verification</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>One account per verified user where enforced: email, username, and phone are unique at registration.</p>\n
                                                                            <p>Identity verification requirements may vary by account, product, and channel. We never promise a single fixed verification path for every user.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="age" data-term-section data-searchable-text="5. Age rules Registration: you confirm you can enter into a binding agreement under applicable law and that the information you provide is accurate. A date of birth may be collected for identity verification and is stored for server-side age checks. Purchase: eligibility to purchase or wager may be checked against product rules, responsible-gaming settings, and account status before an order is accepted. Claim: prize claimants must be 20 years of age or older, calculated from the verified date of birth on file — never from a client-supplied age." aria-labelledby="age-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">05</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="age-title">5. Age rules</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>Registration: you confirm you can enter into a binding agreement under applicable law and that the information you provide is accurate. A date of birth may be collected for identity verification and is stored for server-side age checks.</p>\n
                                                                            <p>Purchase: eligibility to purchase or wager may be checked against product rules, responsible-gaming settings, and account status before an order is accepted.</p>\n
                                                                            <p>Claim: prize claimants must be 20 years of age or older, calculated from the verified date of birth on file — never from a client-supplied age.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="ticket-ownership" data-term-section data-searchable-text="6. Ticket ownership and transfers Lottery ticket numbers are digit strings with leading zeros preserved. For GLO-style L6 prizes, a claim follows the authorized claimant path for the verified holder; tickets are not freely transferable instruments for claiming purposes on this platform. " aria-labelledby="ticket-ownership-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">06</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="ticket-ownership-title">6. Ticket ownership and transfers</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>Lottery ticket numbers are digit strings with leading zeros preserved. For GLO-style L6 prizes, a claim follows the authorized claimant path for the verified holder; tickets are not freely transferable instruments for claiming purposes on this platform.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="responsible-gaming" data-term-section data-searchable-text="7. Responsible gaming Where enabled on your account, you can use self-exclusion, deposit/loss limits, and reality checks from your profile and the responsible-gaming settings. These are player-protection tools, not a statement of regulatory approval. " aria-labelledby="responsible-gaming-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">07</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="responsible-gaming-title">7. Responsible gaming</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>Where enabled on your account, you can use self-exclusion, deposit/loss limits, and reality checks from your profile and the responsible-gaming settings. These are player-protection tools, not a statement of regulatory approval.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
                                <a class="terms-section__back" href="#terms-contents">Back to contents ↑</a>\n
                            </section>\n
                                                                                <section class="terms-section" id="claims" data-term-section data-searchable-text="8. Claims and payouts There is no promise of immediate payment. Claims are subject to result verification, eligibility review, applicable holds, KYC where required, stamp duty calculation, and the approved payout channel. Claim window is 2 years from the draw under configured GLO-compatible rules. " aria-labelledby="claims-title">\n
                                <div class="terms-section__heading">\n
                                    <span class="terms-section__number">08</span>\n
                                    <div>\n
                                        <p class="terms-eyebrow">LEGAL SECTION</p>\n
                                        <h2 id="claims-title">8. Claims and payouts</h2>\n
                                    </div>\n
                                </div>\n
                                <div class="terms-section__body">\n
                                    <p>There is no promise of immediate payment. Claims are subject to result verification, eligibility review, applicable holds, KYC where required, stamp duty calculation, and the approved payout channel. Claim window is 2 years from the draw under configured GLO-compatible rules.</p>\n
                                                                    </div>\n
