## Observed architecture and limits\n
\n
The dashboard has authorized KYC review and reconciliation delegates; it is not entirely read-only. Its result/import projections do not import or publish results.\n
GloImportResult is the dedicated permission-checked CLI intake. DrawResultController delegates ingestion/confirmation/publication to the controlled domain workflow.\n
Source presence and names are not evidence of successful route dispatch, permissions, money execution, official authenticity or browser behavior.\n
No deployment, production migration, queue drain, merchant call or payout is executed by this inventory tool.\n
